#X msg 130 807 @bypass;
#X text 270 807 Bypass flag. If true: bypass 'effected' signal. Type:
bool. Default value: 0\.;
#X msg 130 849 @hold;
#X text 270 849 Hold period. Type: float. Units: 'samp'. Default value:
128\. Range: 1\...255\.;
#X msg 130 891 @knee;
#X text 270 891 A gradual increase in gain reduction around the threshold:
below thresh-(knee/2) there is no gain reduction \, above thresh+(knee/2)
there is the same gain reduction as without a knee \, and in between
there is a gradual increase in gain reduction. Type: float. Units:
'db'. Default value: 3\. Range: 0\...6\.;
#X msg 130 994 @link;
#X text 270 994 The amount of linkage between the channels: 0 = each
channel is independent \, 1 = all channels have the same amount of
gain reduction. Type: float. Default value: 1\. Range: 0\...1\.;
#X msg 130 1066 @range;
#X text 270 1066 Max expand range. Type: float. Units: 'db'. Default
value: -120\. Range: -120\...0\.;
#X msg 130 1108 @refresh;
